---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

---
<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="A decision flow. A slow route leads to the question: is the CPU busy while it is slow? If yes, profile the code to find the one hot function, which is drawn in red. If no, the request is waiting on something: a slow call, a full pool or a queue, handled with timeouts and gates.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Where to look first when one route is slow</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Route chậm thì nhìn đâu trước</tspan></text>
    <rect x="50" y="60" width="160" height="56" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="stopwatch" x={80} y={88} size={26} />
    <text x="104" y="84" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>slow route</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>route chậm</tspan></text>
    <text x="104" y="102" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>p99 is high</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p99 cao</tspan></text>
    <line x1="210" y1="88" x2="281" y2="88" class="arrow-l" /><polygon points="290,88 281,83 281,93" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="290" y="60" width="240" height="56" class="box" />
    <text x="410" y="84" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>CPU busy while it is slow?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>CPU có bận lúc nó chậm?</tspan></text>
    <text x="410" y="102" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>watch top, or ask the profiler</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xem top, hoặc hỏi profiler</tspan></text>
    <line x1="340" y1="116" x2="340" y2="181" class="arrow-l" /><polygon points="340,190 335,181 345,181" class="arrow" />
    <line x1="500" y1="116" x2="500" y2="181" class="arrow-l" /><polygon points="500,190 495,181 505,181" class="arrow" />
    <text x="330" y="160" class="t" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>yes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>có</tspan></text>
    <text x="512" y="160" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>no</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không</tspan></text>
    <rect x="190" y="190" width="240" height="84" class="rbox" />
    <DiagramIcon name="search" x={216} y={232} size={26} />
    <text x="244" y="224" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>profile the code</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>profile code</tspan></text>
    <text x="244" y="244" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>find the one hot function</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tìm đúng hàm nóng</tspan></text>
    <text x="244" y="262" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>pyinstrument, section 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pyinstrument, mục 3</tspan></text>
    <rect x="480" y="190" width="300" height="84" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={506} y={232} size={26} />
    <text x="534" y="224" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>it is waiting</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nó đang chờ</tspan></text>
    <text x="534" y="244" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>slow call, full pool, queue</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lời gọi chậm, pool đầy, hàng đợi</tspan></text>
    <text x="534" y="262" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>timeouts and gates, sections 4-5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>timeout và cổng, mục 4-5</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Two kinds of slow need two different tools. A profiler finds time spent computing; it cannot see time spent waiting.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai kiểu chậm cần hai công cụ khác nhau. Profiler tìm thời gian tính toán; nó không thấy thời gian chờ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig11 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fig11 .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .fig11 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .fig11 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fig11 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .fig11 .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig11 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .fig11 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .fig11 .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig11 .rbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .lead { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .fig11 .rline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .fig11 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .rbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .fig11 .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .fig11 .arrow-l { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 .rarrow { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .rarrow-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
